00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:23.120
So these are not static.

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:26.760
They're just examples of how
things would be connected

00:10:26.760 --> 00:10:31.600
and how they would be configured
across the entire stack.

00:10:34.130 --> 00:10:38.630
OK, so integrating
